["Boost menyala = Shaders otomatis mati (dan sebaliknya)."]={"Boost on = Shaders turn off automatically (and vice versa).","Boost menyala = Shaders otomatis mati (dan sebaliknya).","Boost activo = Shaders se apagan solos (y viceversa).","Boost ligado = Shaders desligam sozinhos (e vice-versa).","Boost activé = Shaders désactivés auto (et inversement).","Boost an = Shader aus (und umgekehrt).","Буст вкл = шейдеры выкл автоматически (и наоборот).","Boost açık = Shader otomatik kapanır (ve tersi).","Bật boost = tự tắt Shader (và ngược lại)."},
["Catatan: ping & jumlah pemain diverifikasi SETELAH masuk server (script harus ikut jalan di server baru: taruh di autoexecute), lalu otomatis hop lagi sampai cocok (maks 6x)."]={"Note: ping & player count are verified AFTER joining (the script must run in the new server: use autoexecute), then it hops again until it matches (max 6x).","Catatan: ping & jumlah pemain diverifikasi SETELAH masuk server (script harus ikut jalan di server baru: taruh di autoexecute), lalu otomatis hop lagi sampai cocok (maks 6x).","Nota: el ping y los jugadores se verifican DESPUÉS de entrar (el script debe correr en el nuevo servidor: usa autoexecute) y vuelve a cambiar hasta cumplir (máx. 6).","Nota: ping e jogadores são verificados DEPOIS de entrar (o script precisa rodar no novo servidor: use autoexecute) e troca de novo até combinar (máx. 6).","Note : le ping et le nombre de joueurs sont vérifiés APRÈS l'arrivée (le script doit tourner sur le nouveau serveur : autoexecute), puis ressaute jusqu'à correspondance (6 max).","Hinweis: Ping & Spielerzahl werden NACH dem Beitritt geprüft (Script muss im neuen Server laufen: Autoexecute), dann erneuter Wechsel bis es passt (max. 6).","Примечание: пинг и число игроков проверяются ПОСЛЕ входа (скрипт должен работать на новом сервере: автозапуск), затем смена повторяется до совпадения (макс. 6).","Not: ping ve oyuncu sayısı girdikten SONRA doğrulanır (script yeni sunucuda çalışmalı: autoexecute), uyana dek tekrar geçer (en çok 6).","Lưu ý: ping & số người được kiểm tra SAU khi vào (script phải chạy ở server mới: dùng autoexecute), rồi tự đổi tiếp đến khi khớp (tối đa 6)."},
["Realistis, Hujan, Badai (petir), Salju, Sunset, Neon Malam, Pagi Kabut, Sinematik. Shaders menyala = FPS Boost mati."]={"10 presets: Realistic, Rain, Storm (lightning), Snow, Sunset, Neon Night, Foggy Morning, Cinematic, Neon Rain, Night Forest. Shaders on = FPS Boost off.","Realistis, Hujan, Badai (petir), Salju, Sunset, Neon Malam, Pagi Kabut, Sinematik. Shaders menyala = FPS Boost mati.","10 preajustes: Realista, Lluvia, Tormenta, Nieve, Atardecer, Noche neón, Niebla, Cine, Lluvia neón, Bosque. Shaders activos = FPS Boost apagado.","10 predefinições: Realista, Chuva, Tempestade, Neve, Pôr do sol, Noite neon, Névoa, Cinema, Chuva neon, Floresta. Shaders ligados = FPS Boost desligado.","10 préréglages : Réaliste, Pluie, Orage, Neige, Coucher de soleil, Nuit néon, Brume, Ciné, Pluie néon, Forêt. Shaders actifs = FPS Boost coupé.","10 Presets: Realistisch, Regen, Sturm, Schnee, Sonnenuntergang, Neon-Nacht, Nebel, Filmisch, Neon-Regen, Nachtwald. Shader an = FPS-Boost aus.","10 пресетов: реализм, дождь, гроза, снег, закат, неон, туман, кино, неоновый дождь, лес. Шейдеры вкл = буст FPS выкл.","10 ön ayar: Gerçekçi, Yağmur, Fırtına, Kar, Gün batımı, Neon gece, Sis, Sinema, Neon yağmur, Orman. Shader açık = FPS Boost kapalı.","10 mẫu: Chân thực, Mưa, Bão, Tuyết, Hoàng hôn, Đêm neon, Sương, Điện ảnh, Mưa neon, Rừng. Bật Shader = tắt Tăng FPS."},
