function U.orbitStart(pl,radius,speed)
U.orbitStop()
if not pl or pl==player then return false end
radius,speed=math.clamp(tonumber(radius)or 6,2,60),math.clamp(tonumber(speed)or 3,0.2,30)
local ang=0
U.orbitPl=pl
local last=os.clock()
local function stepO()
local now=os.clock()
local dt=math.min(now - last,0.1)
last=now
if dt<=0 then return end
local tr=pl.Character and pl.Character:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
local me=myRoot()
if not pl.Parent then U.orbitStop()return end
if not(tr and me)then return end
ang+=dt*speed
local base=U.predCF and U.predCF(tr)or tr.CFrame
local bp=base.Position
local pos=bp+Vector3.new(math.cos(ang)*radius,1.5,math.sin(ang)*radius)
me.CFrame=CFrame.lookAt(pos,bp)
me.AssemblyLinearVelocity=Vector3.zero
end
local cs={RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(stepO),RunService.Stepped:Connect(stepO),RunService.Heartbeat:Connect(stepO)}
U.orbitConn={Disconnect=function()for _,c in ipairs(cs)do pcall(function()c:Disconnect()end)end end}
return true
end
